'main board data stored in NAME1 SCORE1 NAME2 SCORE2.... format. NAME->8 chars/bytes, SCORE->5 chars/bytes
FOR i = 1 TO 2
    serverData = serverData + alphaStringToCode(RTRIM$(user(i).player), 8)
